  "text": "Altitude 1200 meters. Wind shear 45 knots. Commercial transit is grounded. Stratos Docks is under lockdown. Three gunships on the upper pads, but Bay 4 has a heavy transport fueled and idling. That is our ride. Magnetic mooring clamps, reinforced locks. Get me to the release valves, and I will free that bird. Those fuel lines carry liquid hydrogen. One spark could take the deck with it. We keep this clean. Air traffic control is calling in interceptors. The flight grid is trying to pin us on the catwalks. I can cover the flat crossing with my solar barrier. Stay close until we are off the flight line. Dual-phase lasers across the maintenance route. I will cross first and open a path through the security grid. Flight path ready. Once we have the transport, we climb toward the Spire upper command ring. Weapons live. Breach the flight deck, seize that gunship, and take this fight upstairs. Axiom force, move out.",
